      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task. The player must navigate near the oak fence L-shaped pathway (centered around spawn-relative [3, 0, 4]) and face toward it, proving they visually identified the fence. The fence line runs from [3,0,2] to [3,0,6] then east to [6,0,6], so targeting [3,0,4] captures the middle of the main north-south segment. max_distance=5 ensures the player walked toward it (spawn is ~3.6 blocks away from nearest fence), and facing_tolerance=60 ensures intentional observation.",
